 beneath suspicious patches of ground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall Jump:</strong> scale walls and reach dizzying heights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wiggle Butt Dash:</strong> charge through obstacles with full feline commitment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use these abilities to open new paths, uncover secrets, and claw your way up to Sakurana Shrine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922560/extras/ee2d168286b913a9757a75cade3e6c52.poster.avif?t=1781874843\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922560/extras/ee2d168286b913a9757a75cade3e6c52.webm?t=1781874843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922560/extras/ee2d168286b913a9757a75cade3e6c52.mp4?t=1781874843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Cat Food is the Key to Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat food is stashed all over town, tucked by the roadside, buried underground, or sold at the local shop. Eating well builds your stamina, letting you chain Wall Jumps and dash further. Sniff out every last tin to unlock more of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922560/extras/60d9eba2023bb7730c0357bc824317c2.poster.avif?t=1781874843\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922560/extras/60d9eba2023bb7730c0357bc824317c2.webm?t=1781874843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922560/extras/60d9eba2023bb7730c0357bc824317c2.mp4?t=1781874843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Favors, Familiar Faces, and a Town Worth Exploring</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The residents of Nanoha Town have their own small needs, and helping them out usually comes with a reward. Beyond the townsfolk, the town itself is worth lingering in. Cherry petals drift on the breeze, overgrown bus stops and quiet little parks give the place a feeling of somewhere you've been before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a gentle, nostalgic vision of rural Japan. Take your time, sniff around, and enjoy the ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922560/extras/f2dccdbcab6906efe817185be43ebbb9.poster.avif?t=1781874843\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922560/extras/f2dccdbcab6906efe817185be43ebbb9.webm?t=1781874843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922560/extras/f2dccdbcab6906efe817185be43ebbb9.mp4?t=1781874843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Cherry blossoms are falling over Nanoha Town, and one little cat has somewhere to be. A cosy action-adventure through the Japanese countryside.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922560/4cbfaaf7f4d772dc23b65f90acf1e001784a8cb1/header.jpg?t=1781874843", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922560/2e70891d7d2865c9eec59b9c24d1fd8826e0c61b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781874843", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922560/2e70891d7d2865c9eec